{"2002420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Caddywack", "steam_appid": 2002420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Caddywack is an arcade driving game about total car mastery. Drift, launch, and chain aerial tricks through two ways to play: Gridlock Mode, a horde-survival arena where your driving skill is the only thing keeping you alive, and an open city sandbox of taxi missions and combo-chain score chasing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Design:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything in Caddywack runs on one skill: expressive, momentum-driven driving. Drift through tight spaces, launch off ramps, land tricks, and keep your flow alive. Master it once, and the game gives you two places to prove it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Gridlock Mode, the city fights back. Survive escalating waves of hostile traffic in a survivors-style arena where every drift, jump, and trick becomes a survival tool. Carve through the swarm, escape closing rings, and stack auto-firing weapons and upgrades as each run spirals into beautiful chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the open city, chase the perfect run. Accept passenger jobs, optimize routes, chain tricks to extend combo multipliers, and hunt high scores across a dense sandbox built for flow, speed, and replayable mastery.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Caddywack is an arcade driving game about total car mastery. Drift, launch, and chain aerial tricks through two ways to play: Gridlock Mode, a horde-survival arena where your driving skill is the only thing keeping you alive, and an open city sandbox of taxi missions and combo-chain score chasing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Design:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything in Caddywack runs on one skill: expressive, momentum-driven driving. Drift through tight spaces, launch off ramps, land tricks, and keep your flow alive. Master it once, and the game gives you two places to prove it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Gridlock Mode, the city fights back. Survive escalating waves of hostile traffic in a survivors-style arena where every drift, jump, and trick becomes a survival tool. Carve through the swarm, escape closing rings, and stack auto-firing weapons and upgrades as each run spirals into beautiful chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the open city, chase the perfect run. Accept passenger jobs, optimize routes, chain tricks to extend combo multipliers, and hunt high scores across a dense sandbox built for flow, speed, and replayable mastery.</p>", "short_description": "Caddywack is an arcade driving game about total car mastery. Drift, launch, and chain tricks through two ways to play: Gridlock Mode, a horde-survival arena where driving is your weapon, and an open city sandbox of taxi missions and combo-chain score chasing.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2002420/52a9a684f2581b19d5ca1c46a289d93f6e8f577d/header.jpg?t=1784145028", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2002420/3be4992248d493f6e374fa0bea8915234a759647/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784145028", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2002420/3be4992248d493f6e374fa0bea8915234a759647/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784145028", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 (SP1+), Windows 10 and Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86, x64 architecture with SSE2 instruction set support.<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DX10, DX11, DX12 capable.</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Tanssem Studio"], "pub